{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想知每日熱量赤字最終會在體重計上反映多少，Deficit Grams 可以把抽象的卡路里數字換算成實際重量變化。它適合已在使用 Apple Health、飲食記錄 App 或運動手錶，並希望以數據檢視減重進度的人士。此 App 原價 US $1.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-36.webp\">\n<h2>即時換算每日體重變化</h2>\n<p>Deficit Grams 讀取 Apple Health 的飲食熱量、活動消耗與體重紀錄，把淨能量差額即時換算成每日體重變化，直接顯示今天預計增加或減少的克數，毋須自行心算。它可配合慣用的飲食記錄 App 與運動手錶，以互動圖表把每朝實際體重與理論軌跡對照，Apple Watch 錶面亦可查看當日平衡，kcal 與 kJ、kg 與 lb/oz 自由切換。當攝取低於 1,200 kcal 時，預計變化會被遮蔽。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-281-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-282-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-283-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-284-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-285-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Deficit Grams: Weight Tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T05:41:13.724044+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":424,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T05:19:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T01:38:42.598396+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T05:37:39.396970+00:00","content_hash":"6bc1ec1bda355dca30edfc75b9adcf8ed26ea002a0fde298d80173b4f1fc57f3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}